    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0195_3c235f0056f7.png\" style=\"width: 86px; height: 80px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Spiro compound</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0195_d9366b3375b9.png\" style=\"width: 148px; height: 50px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Aromatic compound</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0195_e88726ce56e6.png\" style=\"width: 138px; height: 80px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Non-planar Heterocyclic compound</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0195_6fe07f646366.png\" style=\"width: 85px; height: 80px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Bicyclo compound</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
